# Product imagery artifacts are intentionally NOT ignored:
# public/images/products/*.webp, image-manifest.json and src/data/image-variants.ts
# are all tracked. Vercel's build image has no ffmpeg and its buildCommand runs
# `npm run build` only, so it can neither regenerate the variants nor the lookup
# that five components import. Ignoring them would break every clean build.
# Regenerate all three together with `npm run optimize:images` after touching
# public/images, and commit the result.
